>features</strong> and <strong>upgrades</strong>. Only with the right gear will you have a chance to withstand the dangers out there and return stronger than ever before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799300/extras/426deef9ca5f7ed56525641b2550056b.webp?t=1772561026\" width=349 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Square Shooter</strong></i> is a classic arcade-style top-down shooter where players must fight through consecutive waves of enemies. By destroying asteroids, they collect various resources that contribute to meta-progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These resources allow the unlocking of new weapons and upgrades, enhancing combat power and increasing survivability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>About QuickBug Studios:</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799300/extras/4339b2ed2c88389568c99739ce5d7144.avif?t=1772561026\" width=394 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am a solo developer from the team <strong>QuickBug Studios</strong>. This is my first project, into which I have poured a great deal of time and passion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I sincerely appreciate any support! :D</p>", "short_description": "Square Shooter is a classic arcade-style top-down shooter where players fight their way through consecutive waves of enemies. By destroying asteroids, they collect resources to purchase upgrades and weapons.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Italian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799300/9140dea40a5095a626a5940f8e35e9e88f7f